  "mechanisms": [
    "Connection registration is a local management operation with explicit protected key references and pinned public identities. Its reusable immutable versions are actor private; public HTTP review omits private references/wire bytes.",
    "One strict normalized definition through CLI/HTTPS. Input bounds, duplicate/case-alias and unknown-field rejection, supported task validation, registered connection hash/version checks; no script or unsupported-task fallback.",
    "Read-only preview makes no remote contact or domain mutation; native validation succeeds with selected receiver stopped. Diff exposes both immutable definitions and changed step identities.",
    "Draft versions are immutable and require explicit approval of exact definition hash/state revision under current actor authority. New drafts/connection versions cannot alter queued runs.",
    "Run/events/all delivery intents/all step mappings/idempotency receipt commit in one real PostgreSQL transaction. A last-step binding failure rolls the whole run back.",
    "Twenty domain relations have live-checked forced row security; all five new relations also enforce actor restriction. Composite foreign keys and exact event guards bind state and references.",
    "Deferred SQL constraints require every workflow step and exact source/acceptance/storage/authority/connection/destination binding. Changed definitions and false run success are rejected in real database tests.",
    "Dispatch decisions persist one selected delivery ID before external work. A repeated request key keeps that same step after receipt, server restart or lost final projection. It cannot advance the next step.",
    "Workflow and direct delivery workers check approval, the entire run connection set, current authority/source/storage and every preceding successful receipt at runtime boundaries. Revocation applies consistently through both entry points.",
    "The existing bounded SFTP lease/fence, staged sync/read-back, no-overwrite publication and conservative ambiguity path is reused. Uncertain predecessor blocks later delivery until read-only exact receipt recovery.",
    "Persisted run state and deterministic observed state are separate. Committed receipts survive failed run projection; retry repairs that projection without sending again. Completed observed work cannot be relabelled cancelled merely because its projection lagged.",
    "Queued cancellation fixes exact run revision/hash and atomically cancels eligible remaining intents; live/uncertain effects are refused rather than claimed undone.",
    "Production lease duration, source isolation, assertions and processing time budgets were not relaxed. Native role/actor/tenant/partner denial, frozen versions, revocation, restart and receipt/projection failure cases all pass."
  ],
